{"game": "gunfire-reborn", "language": "english", "appid": 1217060, "month": "2023-01", "window": 3, "start_date": 1673827200, "end_date": 1674518399, "month_true_total": 407, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-27 01:51:10 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "131380892", "author": {"steamid": "76561199157917229", "personaname": "Xernitory", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199157917229/", "num_games_owned": 159, "num_reviews": 41, "playtime_forever": 3861, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1705, "last_played": 1697281069, "avatar": "7619b7699eefa89642d10fafae9aa0ed4d6c5c5f"}, "language": "english", "review": "fun cleave go brrr", "timestamp_created": 1674444168, "timestamp_updated": 1674444168, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "131379592", "author": {"steamid": "76561198116050413", "personaname": "johnny hotwheels", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/jaxxv/", "num_games_owned": 232, "num_reviews": 17, "playtime_forever": 9244, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2626, "last_played": 1778464905, "avatar": "b96a6809b4fc51b33b2f7bd06d86d4630614103e"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game is sooo much fun!! I'm not normally into rogue likes, but this game really makes it enjoyable, probably because of the Borderlands-esque feel to it. It's a ton of fun, the bosses have great designs, the characters all are enjoyable and have interesting power ups that really make your game feel fun. The guns and the scrolls, though, really make the game as fun as it is. \n\nThe only thing I wish there was a bit more of was customization. Maybe some character outfits, gun outfits or something, and ways to adjust your UI. I know having outfits and whatever just begs for premium currency, but I hope that's not the path they would take for it. Some more Gemini inscriptions would be great too. Otherwise this game is perfect honestly. 100% recommend it.", "timestamp_created": 1674441984, "timestamp_updated": 1674441984, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "131377669", "author": {"steamid": "76561198064252295", "personaname": "yao ming cooka da pizza", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/SCOUT_HEADSHOT_MAD_LOL/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 3692, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2411, "last_played": 1705376732, "avatar": "cfa66863fd543f96d7a39b754afcc38e22925088"}, "language": "english", "review": "I have fun but sometimes i just want to go to bed", "timestamp_created": 1674439214, "timestamp_updated": 1674439214, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "131376557", "author": {"steamid": "76561198149740077", "personaname": "Janspach", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Janspach/", "num_games_owned": 2149, "num_reviews": 375, "playtime_forever": 1230, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1230, "last_played": 1637228962, "avatar": "7643c6a5a2d43af419afa7c656d1fb7e2c1fdcd8"}, "language": "english", "review": "Addicting roguelite game that d